Epoch_childWithdraw_CcipFork
├── given the active strategy is remote on Arbitrum or Polygon
├── and the depositor has claimed shares from a prior fork epoch deposit
├── and the depositor submits a full share withdraw intent
├── when CRE closes the epoch through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should mark the epoch executing
├── when CRE withdraws from the selected child's Aave V3 through Child WorkflowRouter
├── and local CCIP routes USDC back to Base
├── then ParentVault should mark the epoch claimable
├── and the depositor should claim USDC on Parent
└── and the depositor share balance should be zero
